  "title": "packet-woww.c: Avoid use of uninitialized memory",
  "description": "The guid is allocated from the heap. Bytes corresponding\nto unset bits in byte_mask are never written, exposing heap contents via\ntvb_new_child_real_data. Fix by replacing wmem_alloc with wmem_alloc0.\n\nAI-Assisted: yes (Claude Sonnet 4.6)",
